    "body": "Good point @ayg, I remember now that this has come up before, but I'd forgotten it. Per spec \"application/xml\" is the default and it's never overridden, but Blink indeed does special case the XHTML and SVG namespaces. (So much about Document and its subinterfaces is subtly wrong per spec, so much to sort out...)\n",
